classDiagram
  class ChatMediator {
    <<interface>>
    +register(user: User) void
    +send(from: User, message, to?) void
  }
  class ChatRoom {
    -Map~string, User~ users
    -Set~string~ muted
    +register(user: User) void
    +mute(name) void
    +send(from: User, message, to?) void
  }
  class User {
    +string name
    -ChatMediator mediator
    +send(message, to?) void
    +receive(from, message) void
  }
  ChatMediator <|.. ChatRoom
  ChatRoom o--> "*" User : conhece todos
  User --> ChatMediator : só conhece o mediador
  note for ChatRoom "Concentra as regras de comunicação<br/>(broadcast, privado, silenciados)"
